[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「茉子，我就这样射了」","art":{"background":"a2675","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「好、好的……射吧、啊、啊、啊……请射出来吧、求你了」","art":{"background":"a2677","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「不行了……啊、啊、啊、啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊————————————！」","art":{"background":"a2676","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"从下半身窜起的快感，被我全部喷吐在茉子体内。","art":{"background":"a2678","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「嗯嗯啊！啊、啊、啊、啊啊啊啊啊嗯嗯！？」","art":{"background":"a2678","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"我的精液……咕嘟咕嘟地注入了茉子体内。","art":{"background":"a2678","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"肉棒每次鼓胀、泄出精液的时候，茉子身体就会出现一阵抽动。","art":{"background":"a2678","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「唔……啊啊啊……好厉害……肚子里热乎乎的，一股脑儿地扩散开来……」","art":{"background":"a2679","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈啊、啊哈啊……嗯、嗯嗯！」","art":{"background":"a2680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"咕嘟……！","art":{"background":"a2680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"},{"speaker":"","text":"再喷完最后一次之后，我的射精终于停止了。","art":{"background":"a2680","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-5"}]